{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f<strong>Star Soraight Fantasy: Magic to reach the sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u7d39\u4ecb\uff3f.gif?t=1747277743\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tokino Sora-chan is suddenly whisked away to another world in the middle of her live performance! <br>A mysterious realm where her Hololive comrades and their precious items are scattered. <br>Can Sora-chan unravel the secrets of this strange world and make it back to her stage!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide Sora-chan\u2019s story to a dazzling finale with your own hands!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u30e1\u30a4\u30f3\uff1a\u304a\u8a71\u3057\u306e\u59cb\u307e\u308a\uff3fWS00137.png?t=1747277743\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f<strong>Explore and Conquer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey between the vibrant \u201cThe Nun Nun Square\u201d and the enigmatic \u201cMysterious Tower\u201d in a blend of 2D and 3D.  <br>Tackle intricate terrains, battle formidable foes, and dive into dynamic action and exploration alongside Sora-chan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u30e1\u30a4\u30f3\uff1a\u5192\u967a\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\uff3fWS00018.png?t=1747277743\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f<strong>Team Up with the Holomen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sora isn\u2019t alone\u2014her Holomen friends have also been transported to this strange world!  <br>Find them, harness their unique skills, and band together to conquer the tower\u2019s depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u30e1\u30a4\u30f3\uff1a\u5192\u967a\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8+\u30db\u30ed\u30e1\u30f3\uff3f\uff3fWS00088.png?t=1747277743\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1fPower Up with Holomen Items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scattered throughout the tower are special items imbued with the Holomen\u2019s powers.  <br>Collect them to enhance Sora\u2019s abilities and unlock new paths in your adventure.  <br>The more you find, the stronger you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u30e1\u30a4\u30f3\uff1a\u30db\u30ed\u30e1\u30f3\u30a2\u30a4\u30c6\u30e0\u53d6\u5f97\uff3fWS00163.png?t=1747277743\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1fRide the Sora Train and explore the tower with total freedom! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This incredible train whisks you instantly from the tower\u2019s base to its deepest reaches, letting you move as you please. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim for a 100% exploration rate as you uncover every corner of this tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u305d\u3089\u30c8\u30ec\u30a4\u30f3\uff3fWS00178.png?t=1747277743\" /><strong></strong><br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1fUncover the Secret of the Sora Coins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt for elusive \u201cSora Coins\u201d hidden within the tower.  <br>Gather as many as you can and deliver them to a mysterious character for exclusive rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u305d\u3089\u30b3\u30a4\u30f3\u30b2\u30c3\u30c8\uff3fWS00187.png?t=1747277743\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf1fSora\u2019s Irresistible Charm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the thrilling main story, revel in Sora\u2019s adorable dance moves, expressive poses, and vibrant emotions.  <br>Customize her look and soak in her charm at every turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668950/extras/\u30b5\u30d6\uff1a\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u3084\u30a8\u30e2\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\uff3fWS00156.png?t=1747277743\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Sora and the Holomen in Star Soraito Fantasy for a sparkling adventure filled with action, exploration, and heartwarming moments.</strong><br><strong>Solve the mysteries of another world and return to original world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.  <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstati